    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Demonic Strikes"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "[Initial] Your eidolon's attacks are corrupted by the Abyss and imbued with pure evil and shifting chaos. All your eidolon's unarmed Strikes deal an extra 1 evil damage; as usual, this extra damage harms only good creatures or those with a weakness to evil damage. Additionally, choose one of your eidolon's unarmed attacks that deals physical damage; it gains the versatile trait for a different type of physical damage you choose."
            },
            "id": "f56fa3da-1949-47be-b3a3-9fe57cb83a4b",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:18.491302"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Visions of Sin"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "[Symbiosis] Your demon is born of sin and can project the sin it is formed from into the minds of others. It gains the Visions of Sin activity."
            },
            "id": "ecdd78c5-8645-433e-b292-cf05ccb02a39",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:18.491302"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Blasphemous Decree"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "[Transcendence] Your demon utters indescribable words writhing with its associated sin. It can cast an evil divine decree once per day as a 9th-level spell. You are unaffected by this decree, even if you aren't evil. At 19th level, this becomes a 10th-level divine decree instead."
            },
            "id": "3e41bbdc-1ac5-4a17-a6f3-7e38d85bdcf8",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:18.491302"
